===Etymology 1===
From [[Ukrainian]] ''сікти'' "to chop" — meaning to clear a forest for an encampment, or to build a fort with cut down trees.<ref>[[:w:Dmytro Yavornytsky|Dmytro Yavornytsky]] ''Історія Запорізьких Козаків'' (in Ukrainian), Vol.1, 1892</ref>

====Noun====
{{en-noun}}

# Administrative and military centre for the [[Zaporizhia|Zaporozhian]] and Danube [[Cossacks]].

